  "authoritative_metadata": "manifest.json",
  "title": "A learner that grows only when stuck",
  "status": "Proved",
  "claim": "The dissonance weight W = violated lines + E + |D|/2 is at least |chi|/2 in every state of every law (proved from the count), so a knot sphere's flat state is at its floor and a learner that waits for W to fall is stuck at once; one Fano atom grown from a sphere gives a torus (floor 0) and every further atom raises the floor by one (proved). Computed on K_2-K_5 (and K_6 one size past): a learner that grows an atom only when no sequence of at most r learning steps lowers W grows at the dissonance at once; with r >= 3 it grows once and resolves in 3 sign changes, with r <= 2 it grows again and never resolves.",
